, Wissenschaft, Technik, Kunst und Kultur bei. Historische Einblicke und inspirierende Portraits von DAAD-Alumni und -Alumnae zeigen, wie Austausch die Welt gestern, heute und morgen prägt.",{"src":180,"alt":177,"copyright":190},{"large":181,"medium":185,"small":189},{"href":182,"width":183,"height":184},"https:\u002F\u002Fapi.daad.de\u002Fapi\u002Fimage\u002Fenhancedteaserwilg\u002Fmedia\u002Fdaad_de\u002Fder-daad\u002Fwer-wir-sind\u002Fwandel_durch_austausch.jpg.webp",480,318,{"href":186,"width":187,"height":188},"https:\u002F\u002Fapi.daad.de\u002Fapi\u002Fimage\u002Fenhancedteaserwism\u002Fmedia\u002Fdaad_de\u002Fder-daad\u002Fwer-wir-sind\u002Fwandel_durch_austausch.jpg.webp",288,191,{"href":182,"width":183,"height":184},"© DAAD",[192],{"url":193,"type":95,"text":194,"additionalText":8,"tracking":195},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.daad.de\u002Fde\u002Fder-daad\u002Fwer-wir-sind\u002Fwandel-durch-austausch\u002F","Mehr erfahren",{"title":196},null,{"id":198,"name":199,"template":200,"data":201,"lazy":18,"ssr":19},"newsroom_teaser_list_100_13","Newsroom Teaser List","newsroom_teaser_list",{"theme":202,"headline":203,"hideHeadline":19,"teaser":204,"tabs":206},"light","DAAD Neuigkeiten",{"numVisible":205},9,[207,400,490,582],{"headline":208,"teasers":209},"Alles",[210,238,260,279,299,319,339,368,377],{"type":211,"layout":212,"date":213,"sortDate":214,"headline":215,"image":216,"text":234,"link":235},"article","big","22.10.2026 | DAAD Journal","920261022","„Wir brauchen eine akademische Kultur, in der Wissenschaftsfreiheit gelebt wird“",{"src":217,"alt":232,"copyright":233},{"extraLarge":218,"large":222,"medium":226,"small":229},{"href":219,"width":220,"height":221},"https:\u002F\u002Fapi.daad.de\u002Fapi\u002Fimage\u002Fnrsxltop\u002Fmedia\u002Fdaad_de\u002Fder-daad\u002F_hp_2518_journal.jpg.webp",612,344,{"href":223,"width":224,"height":225},"https:\u002F\u002Fapi.daad.de\u002Fapi\u002Fimage\u002Fnrslgtop\u002Fmedia\u002Fdaad_de\u002Fder-daad\u002F_hp_2518_journal.jpg.we